# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ishtar workspace - root ignore rules
#
# Written by Faz 1.1 (Version Control Bootstrap) from a measured size survey,
# not an estimate. Every rule below has a recorded reason in
# UNTRACKED-BY-DESIGN.md at the workspace root.
#
# Exclusion is not loss. Before concluding that a path is missing from this
# repository, read UNTRACKED-BY-DESIGN.md - it says which paths are excluded,
# why, and how each one is recovered.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Credentials -----------------------------------------------------------
# Mandatory, and first in this file on purpose. Faz 1.1's risk register makes
# this the single ordering constraint inside Phase 1: the rule must exist
# before the first commit, or the signing key enters history permanently and
# only a history rewrite removes it. Faz 1.2 audits the released archives for
# a key that already escaped; this rule only stops the next one.
debug.keystore
*.keystore
*.jks

# --- Kernel and platform checkouts -----------------------------------------
# Externally sourced, ~6.9 GiB combined, re-clonable. Anchored to the root so
# a same-named directory added deeper in the tree is not silently swallowed.
/android_kernel_qcom_sm8550/
/android_kernel_xiaomi_sm8550/
/common_sm8550/
/platform-tools/

# --- Reference trees -------------------------------------------------------
# Comparison sources and upstream module trees, not project deliverables.
/refs/
/13U-989-DCG16+LN2+LN4/
/Module_Highres_13U_Switcher_A14/

# --- Upstream device tree --------------------------------------------------
# device_ishtar/ is its own git clone (AOSPA upstream, branch vauxite) with
# full history and a remote. It already has the rollback path this sub-phase
# exists to create, and nesting it here would store a gitlink that restores
# no file content. See UNTRACKED-BY-DESIGN.md.
/device_ishtar/

# --- Root binaries, release snapshots, and logs ----------------------------
/com.qti.sensormodule.ishtar_semco_imx989_wide.bin
*.apk
*.zip
*.log

# --- Regenerable module artifacts ------------------------------------------
# Sensor blob variants and the active blob: regenerated by the scripts in
# ishtar-cam-modes/tools/. The .patch files in blobs/ are NOT ignored - they
# are the highest-value irreplaceable artifacts in the project.
ishtar-cam-modes/blobs/*.bin
ishtar-cam-modes/active/*.bin
# Faz 5.1 candidate blobs: regenerated by tools/mode0_12bit.py, and kept
# out of blobs/ so no mode switch can select an unproven variant.
ishtar-cam-modes/candidates/*.bin

# Tile application build output: regenerated by tile-app/build.sh from the
# tracked java/, res/, and AndroidManifest.xml sources.
ishtar-cam-modes/tile-app/out/

# Python bytecode caches.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Local tooling state ---------------------------------------------------
# Per-machine Claude Code permission state, not a project artifact.
/.claude/settings.local.json
